@startuml
actor PE
participant Console
participant "Scoped monitoring service" as Service
participant "Owned target / binding repository" as Repository
participant "Private credentials resolver" as Secrets
participant "Prometheus adapter" as Adapter
participant Prometheus
participant "Git/Fleet delivery" as CD
participant Alertmanager
participant "Test receiver" as Receiver
PE -> Console : Register/test connection; bind Environment
Console -> Service : Authorized connection/binding request
Service -> Repository : Validate organization, revision, cluster pin
Service -> Secrets : Resolve scoped credential privately
Service -> Adapter : Test connectivity and coverage
Adapter -> Prometheus : Bounded query
PE -> Console : Deploy owned test app
Console -> CD : Existing deployment with app-owned rules
CD -> Prometheus : Operator loads PrometheusRule
Console -> Service : Read selected app/Environment/time
Service -> Repository : Authorize; restore owned targets
Service -> Adapter : Server-defined scoped metrics/rules
Adapter -> Prometheus : Bounded read
Prometheus --> Console : Via service: samples, timestamps, coverage, alerts
Prometheus -> Alertmanager : Firing / resolved
Alertmanager -> Receiver : Actual test notification
note over Console, Receiver : Delivery requires independent evidence; absent metrics never mean recovery
@enduml
